<title>USA: CCAIR offers Barlow Partners board seat.</title>
<headline>CCAIR offers Barlow Partners board seat.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barlow Partners L.P. said Monday it was advised by CCAIR Inc that it intends to offer them a seat on its board of directors.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the partners, including James Swigart and Jonathan Ornstein, currently hold a 6.6 percent stake in CCAIR, or 510,200 common shares. Outstanding shares total 7,740,695 common.</p>
<p>The other two members of Barlow Partners are George Murnane III, its sole general partner, and Alexius Dyer III.</p>
<p>CCAIR, of Charlotte, N.C., is an airline.</p>
